<title>CANADA: Rogers Cantel to buy back 5.3 pct B shares.</title>
<headline>Rogers Cantel to buy back 5.3 pct B shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rogers Cantel Mobile Communications Inc said it intends to initiate a normal course issuer bid for about 5.3 percent of its class B subordinate voting shares through the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Cantel said purchases made through the bid will not exceed one million class B shares or one percent of the total number of outstanding class A multiple voting shares and class B shares over a 12 month period commencing upon regulatory approval.</p>
<p>The company said approval is expected no later than the end of March 1997. ((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
